{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】政府今日(10月30日)舉行兩場改革措施記者會，分別為改革樓宇維修監管制度，以及打擊圍標措施。同日，立法會鐵路事宜小組委員會開會，討論藍田站兩宗事故。</p><p>採訪日誌｜政府改革措施記者會／立法會委員會討論藍田站事故</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:37:40.073234+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:22:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:13.343177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:13.343177+00:00","content_hash":"c1ebfd90488dec9e34191a7123e971cfa7a97eb57f5c81ecd718abfd36ed1eb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}